Name: uBlock Origin
Short Name: ublock
URL: https://github.com/gorhill/uBlock
Version: 1.75.0
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: GPL-3.0
License File: LICENSE.txt
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes

Description:
uBlock Origin's scriptlets and redirect resources, which Pantera turns into
the separate resources.json file its ad blocker ships with (DECISION-14).
Downloaded at build time from the release pinned in downloads-adblock.ini.

Local Modifications:
None. Only resources.json, generated by
//pantera/components/adblock/resources/build_adblock_resources.mjs, ships.
